{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1480.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"b6ba96451402f4fb4e7228b4214f348dbb23e52791748d14ea0254dc00820691","ja":"そうですね。ファンの期待に応えようとする姿勢は、\nとても素晴らしいと思いますが……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1480.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"8d111deaf039a9b083d1fdd10e1025dc3e7c26bd646d3c4a842f0fd08f417d07","ja":"木下さんの負担になるなら、\n無理をしてまでやるべきではないかと。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
